OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor hits back at
OL,4,A'outrageous' bypass claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of Herefordshire's ruling
OL,7,Fcabinet has hit back at claims that the
OL,8,F#45m first phase of Hereford's bypass
OL,9,Fis being rushed into for political
OL,10,Freasons.
OL,12,FIt comes after councillor Liz Harvey,
OL,13,Fleader of Independents for
OL,14,FHerefordshire, said phase one, between
OL,15,Fthe A49 and A465 southwest of the city,
OL,16,Fneeded "more work to demonstrate value
OL,17,Ffor money".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
