OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor hits back at
OL,4,A'outrageous' bypass claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarvey added that the Conservative-led
OL,7,Fadministration's desire to "get spades
OL,8,Fin the ground" by December, ahead of
OL,9,Flocal elections the following May,
OL,10,F"risks turning a major infrastructure
OL,11,Fdecision into a cynical electoral
OL,12,Fcalculation".
OL,14,FCouncillor Dan Hurcomb, from the
OL,15,FConservative group, said the accusation
OL,16,Fwas "outrageous".
